  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Terrence Doyle",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:04:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:04:28-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin, Terrence Doyle here. I'm calling for my mother, she's at 128 Rhode Island Avenue, up on the Hill. Hang on, I'm walking, I'm in a hallway, you might hear me echo."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:04:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I can hear you fine. What's going on at 128?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:04:46-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Her recycling bin got left at the curb this morning with a tag on it saying it was rejected. Didn't take it. She's in her eighties, she's not putting anything in there that shouldn't be."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:04:59-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so recycling bin, tagged as rejected, 128 Rhode Island Avenue. Did the tag say why? Usually they check a box or write a reason."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:05:09-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me see, I took a picture of it. [pause] It's got a box checked, says contaminated, and something handwritten, I can't make it out. Maybe plastic bags? She might've bagged some stuff."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:05:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the usual one. Loose items only, no bagged recycling. That could be it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:05:27-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, that's a start. But I'd like a supervisor to call me back about it, just so I understand what they saw and when she can put it out again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:05:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can put in that request. Best number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:05:43-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0194."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:05:44-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-four. Terrence Doyle, calling about the rejected bin at 128 Rhode Island Avenue. I'll pass it along today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:05:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. And she should just leave it where it is till then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:05:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, have her take the bags out and leave it be. The supervisor can tell you about the next pickup."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:06:06-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:06:08-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You bet. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
